  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "しずかに　せいしんを　とういつし\nこころを　しずめる　ことで　じぶんの\nとくこうと　とくぼうを　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "조용히 정신을 통일하고\n마음을 가라앉혀서 자신의\n특수공격과 특수방어를 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "屏氣凝神，\n提高自己的特攻和特防。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur se concentre et fait le vide dans son esprit\npour augmenter son Attaque Spéciale\net sa Défense Spéciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Erhöht Spezial-Angriff und Spezial-Verteidigung durch\nKonzentration.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Aumenta la concentración y calma el espíritu para subir\nel Ataque Especial y la Defensa Especial.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa placa il proprio spirito meditando per\naumentare l’Attacco Speciale e la Difesa Speciale.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user quietly focuses its mind and calms its\nspirit to raise its Sp. Atk and Sp. Def stats.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "静かに　精神を　統一し\n心を　鎮めることで　自分の\n特攻と　特防を　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "静心凝神，\n从而提高自己的特攻和特防。",
      "version_group": {
